Last Idea is an open-source Markdown idea catcher rebuilt from the supplied
legacy APK assets.

This project does not bundle proprietary app code, legacy ad SDK identifiers,
network dependencies, plaintext password storage, or rules text from that app.
The included visual/font assets came from the supplied APK archive and should be
redistributed only where the project has the rights to do so.

EB Garamond is bundled as the default app font from Google Fonts under the
SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1. See
app/src/main/assets/fonts/eb_garamond_OFL.txt.
